# MCP Server Implementation Guidelines

## Server Configuration
- Server runs on port 3000 by default (configurable in .env)
- Implements the Model Context Protocol for AI integration
- Provides narrative generation endpoints for the Bard system

## API Endpoints
- `generateNarrative`: Creates narrative text for game events
- `getCharacterMemories`: Retrieves stored memories for a character
- `updateMemory`: Stores new memories for a character

## Implementation Requirements
- Use Node.js for the server implementation
- Implement proper error handling and logging
- Ensure asynchronous processing to avoid blocking
- Cache responses when appropriate to reduce API calls 